  RootNode:
    dialogues:
    - y:Sir.
    - "Grandpa:There\u2019s no need to be so formal with me, young man."
    - "y:I just call everyone the same way. Here\u2019s your food, sir. How was the
      cold medicine?"
    - "Grandpa:It was helpful, thank you. But really, there\u2019s no need to waste
      resources on me. Rather, I see you\u2019ve been hanging around Clare."
    - "y:Yes. She\u2019s very sweet. Are you familiar with her?"
    - "Grandpa:That girl\u2026it\u2019s truly unfair. She doesn\u2019t deserve to
      suffer so much at such a young age. She doesn\u2019t speak very well; no one
      was ever willing to help her. I just have one request: Please look after her."
    - y:Of course, you can trust me on that.
    - Grandpa:*cough**cough*
    - The old man coughs up blood.
    - y:Sir!
    - "Grandpa:You should leave. You\u2019re on a timer too, aren\u2019t you?"
